  "description": "The native payload for Agora's AV1 video encoder extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.7.0 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. AV1 encoding, for the bandwidth saving over H.264 where both ends support it. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS, not Net.Agora.Voice.iOS, which lacks a framework this one links — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraVideoEncoderConfiguration with an AV1 codec type in the RTC binding.",
